      <h2 id="words-eps-en-title">Try the first two decks free</h2>
      <p>There are seven EPS-TOPIK (Employment Permit Korean) vocabulary decks. <strong>EPS-1 and EPS-2 are free.</strong> EPS-3–7 need the optional bundle or Premium access.</p>
      <p>The standard free allowance is 20 new words and 10 quizzes a day. Reviews of learned words are unlimited. Optional rewarded ads can extend the daily allowance.</p>
      <p>The app has ads and optional in-app purchases. Premium offers a monthly auto-renewing subscription or a one-time lifetime purchase. Use the Google Play buttons on this page for Android.</p>
